Most common reason this lab fails

The deployment command:

cp -r ./* /var/www/html/

does not copy hidden files. To ensure the entire working tree (including dotfiles if needed) is copied while excluding the Git metadata, a more robust deployment is:

pipeline {
    agent {
        label 'stapp01'
    }

    stages {
        stage('Deploy') {
            steps {
                dir('/var/www/html/web_app') {
                    sh '''
                        git reset --hard
                        git pull origin main || git pull origin master

                        find /var/www/html -mindepth 1 -maxdepth 1 ! -name web_app -exec rm -rf {} +

                        cp -a . /var/www/html/
                        rm -rf /var/www/html/.git
                    '''
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

This version works whether the repository uses main or master, preserves file attributes, copies hidden files, and ensures the website is served directly from /var/www/html rather than /web_app.
